    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You (Masato Kasuta) were kicked out of the company dormitory due to restructuring, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and since you had no choice, you moved into a cheap rental apartment for the time being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While browsing the Internet while receiving unemployment benefits, I found an advertisement that said.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>&quot;Mail order site: ByonByon\u00a0 Customer support wanted!\u00a0 Start now from home!&quot;</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Customer support... I think someone said late at night is relatively free...\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you (Masato Kasuta), who joined the company as a part-time worker for the time being, decided to experience the business for five days...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Flow:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the customer's problems</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask questions and make suggestions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide on an appropriate response</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game PC control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some complaints based on true stories appeared</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parody, Respect</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You (Masato Kasuta) were kicked out of the company dormitory due to restructuring, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and since you had no choice, you moved into a cheap rental apartment for the time being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While browsing the Internet while receiving unemployment benefits, I found an advertisement that said.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>&quot;Mail order site: ByonByon\u00a0 Customer support wanted!\u00a0 Start now from home!&quot;</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Customer support... I think someone said late at night is relatively free...\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you (Masato Kasuta), who joined the company as a part-time worker for the time being, decided to experience the business for five days...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Flow:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the customer's problems</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask questions and make suggestions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide on an appropriate response</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game PC control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some complaints based on true stories appeared</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parody, Respect</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cUgh~... Why do I get nothing but weird customers...\u201d Become Masato Kasuda, a new customer support representative, and experience the first five days of the program! Be careful, there are a lot of strange customers at night!",
